{"id": "90010012", "name": "שארית בקוטב מסדר גבוה – e^{az} חלקי (z−b)^m", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונה הפונקציה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f(z)={{CT:0}}. \\]</p><p>לפונקציה יש קוטב מסדר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:1}}\\)</span> בנקודה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(z_0={{CT:2}}\\)</span>.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>חשבו את השארית <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\operatorname{Res}_{z={{CT:2}}} f(z)\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\operatorname{Res}_{z={{CT:2}}} f(z)=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(e^{k}\\)</span> מזינים <code dir=\"ltr\">exp(k)</code> (אפשר גם <code dir=\"ltr\">%e^k</code>), למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">exp(7)/5</code>. עצרת מזינים עם סימן קריאה, למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">3!</code>.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> בקוטב מסדר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(m\\)</span> של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f(z)=\\dfrac{g(z)}{(z-z_0)^m}\\)</span>, כאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g\\)</span> אנליטית ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(z_0\\)</span>, השארית היא המקדם של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((z-z_0)^{m-1}\\)</span> בטור טיילור של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g\\)</span> סביב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(z_0\\)</span>, כלומר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\dfrac{g^{(m-1)}(z_0)}{(m-1)!}\\)</span>. נחשב אותה בנוסחה, ונוודא בעזרת טור לורן.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — הנוסחה לשארית בקוטב מסדר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(m={{CT:1}}\\)</span></b><br>כאן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(z_0={{CT:2}}\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g(z)=(z-z_0)^m f(z)={{CT:3}}\\)</span>, ש-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g(z_0)\\ne 0\\)</span>. לכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\operatorname{Res}_{z=z_0} f=\\frac{1}{(m-1)!}\\,g^{(m-1)}(z_0)=\\frac{1}{ {{CT:4}}!}\\,g^{({{CT:4}})}({{CT:2}}). \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — הנגזרת</b><br>כל גזירה של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:3}}\\)</span> מוסיפה גורם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:5}}\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ g^{({{CT:4}})}(z)={{CT:6}},\\qquad g^{({{CT:4}})}({{CT:2}})={{CT:7}}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — השארית</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\operatorname{Res}_{z={{CT:2}}} f=\\frac{ {{CT:7}} }{ {{CT:8}} }={{CT:9}}. \\]</p><b>בדיקה בעזרת טור לורן:</b> [[if test=\"{{CT:11}}\"]]<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(e^{ {{CT:5}} z}=\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\frac{({{CT:5}})^n}{n!}z^n\\)</span>. אחרי חלוקה ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(z^{ {{CT:1}} }\\)</span> האיבר עם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(z^{-1}\\)</span> הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(n={{CT:4}}\\)</span>, ומקדמו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\dfrac{({{CT:5}})^{ {{CT:4}} }}{ {{CT:4}}!}={{CT:9}}\\)</span>.[[else]]<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(e^{ {{CT:5}} z}=e^{ {{CT:10}} }\\,e^{ {{CT:5}}(z-z_0)}=e^{ {{CT:10}} }\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\frac{({{CT:5}})^n}{n!}(z-z_0)^n\\)</span>. אחרי חלוקה ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\((z-z_0)^{ {{CT:1}} }\\)</span> האיבר עם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((z-z_0)^{-1}\\)</span> הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(n={{CT:4}}\\)</span>, ומקדמו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(e^{ {{CT:10}} }\\dfrac{({{CT:5}})^{ {{CT:4}} }}{ {{CT:4}}!}={{CT:9}}\\)</span>.[[/if]]<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\operatorname{Res}_{z={{CT:2}}} f(z)={{CT:9}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "res", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-0-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-0-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "w1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">שכחתם לחלק ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\((m-1)!={{CT:8}}\\)</span>: השארית היא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{1}{(m-1)!}g^{(m-1)}(z_0)\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "w2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">גזרתם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(m\\)</span> פעמים במקום <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(m-1\\)</span>: השארית היא המקדם של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((z-z_0)^{-1}\\)</span>, ולכן צריך את המקדם של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((z-z_0)^{m-1}\\)</span> בטור של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "w4", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">הנגזרת נכונה, אבל המכנה צריך להיות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((m-1)!\\)</span> ולא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(m!\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 4, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 4, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "w3", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-4-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">חסר הגורם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(e^{ {{CT:10}} }\\)</span>: את הנגזרת של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g\\)</span> מציבים בנקודה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(z_0={{CT:2}}\\)</span>, לא ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(0\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-4-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">השתמשו בנוסחה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\operatorname{Res}_{z=z_0} f=\\frac{1}{(m-1)!}g^{(m-1)}(z_0)\\)</span> עם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g(z)=(z-z_0)^m f(z)\\)</span>.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["dg", "eab", "fm1", "fz", "gz", "ka", "kb", "km1", "m", "m1", "res", "w1", "w2", "w3", "w4"], "nvariants": 50}